  {
    "id": "point-total",
    "name": "Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochTotalAverageVariance_fullBatch_lt_of_exactCriticalSignalSquareCondition",
    "typeText": "\u2200 (point : Mf.DP.PoissonFixedEpochPoint) (sensitivity epsilon delta energy : \u211d),\n  point.epoch < point.horizon \u2192\n    \u2200 (hSensitivity : 0 < sensitivity) (hEpsilon : 0 < epsilon) (hDeltaPos : 0 < delta) (hDeltaLtOne : delta < 1),\n      0 \u2264 energy \u2192\n        Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochExactCriticalSignalSquareCondition point epsilon\n            (Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochStandardizedSignal sensitivity\n              \u2191(Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochFullBatchCalibratedRunVariance sensitivity epsilon delta hSensitivity \u22ef hDeltaPos\n                  hDeltaLtOne)) \u2192\n          Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochTotalAverageVariance (Mf.DP.PoissonFixedEpochPoint.fullBatch point.epoch \u22ef) sensitivity\n              epsilon delta energy <\n            Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochTotalAverageVariance point sensitivity epsilon delta energy",
    "source": {
      "path": "Mf/DP/PoissonFixedEpochPointwiseDominanceDomain.lean",
      "digest": "sha256:88db8d26189787583e57c4fbd881671d3068ca74cec72cd8ae6cda3610e92d43",
